{
  "title": "Hirz-e-Imam Ali al-Naqi (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This evil-repelling prayer is ascribed to Imam Ali ibn Muhammad al-Naqi al-Hadi (a.s.):\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-Merciful, the Ever-Merciful.\nيَا عَزِيْزَ الْعِزِّ فِىْ عِزِّهٖ \nYAA A’ZEEZAL I’ZZE FEE I’ZZEHI \nO Almighty of all might in His absolute power! \nمَا اَعَزَّ عَزِيْزَ الْعِزِّ فِىْ عِزِّهٖ \nMAA A-A’ZZA A’ZEEZAL I’ZZE FEE I’ZZEHI\nHow mighty is the Almighty of all might in His absolute power!\nيَا عَزِيْزُ اَعِزَّنِىْ بِعِزِّكَ وَ اَيِّدْنِىْ بِنَصْرِكَ \nYAA A’ZEEZO A-I’ZZANEE BE-I’ZZEKA WA AYYIDNEE BE-NASREKA\nO Almighty! Honor me with Your might, support me with Your victory, \nوَ ادْفَعْ عَنِّىْ هَمَزَاتِ الشَّيَاطِيْنِ \nWAD FA’ A’NNEE HAMAZAATISH SHAYAATEENE\nrepel from me the incitements of the devils, \nوَ ادْفَعْ عَنِّىْ بِدَفْعِكَ وَ امْنَعْ عَنِّىْ بِصُنْعِكَ \nWAD FA’ A’NNEE BE-DAF-E’KA WAM NA’ A’NNEE BE-SUN-E’KA\ndefend me with Your defense, and shield me through Your divine craftsmanship.\nوَ اجْعَلْنِىْ مِنْ خِيَارِ خَلْقِكَ \nWAJ A’LNEE MIN KHEYAARE KHALQEKA \nAnd count me among the best of Your creation, \nيَا وَاحِدُ يَا اَحَدُ يَا فَرْدُ يَا صَمَدُ.\nYAA WAAHEDO YAA AHADO YAA FARDO YAA SAMADO.\nO One! O Unique! O Solitary! O Eternal Refuge!"
}
